<title>USA: American Mobile names Robert Goldsmith COO.</title>
<headline>American Mobile names Robert Goldsmith COO.</headline>
<dateline>RESTON, Va. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Mobile Satellite Corp Monday said it named Robert Goldsmith to the position of executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Goldsmith succeeds Brian Pemberton, who left the company at the beginning of the year.</p>
<p>Goldsmith assumes leadership responsibility for areas of sales and marketing, operations, engineering and customer service, the company said.</p>
